# The 2.1 GB of Geofabrik extracts and the local mirror tree they live in.
# Pulled by deploy/mirror/geofabrik_pull.py (see README.md) — never committed:
# they are upstream bytes, they are pinned by date rather than by content here,
# and ODbL redistribution of a mirrored extract is a deliberate act with its own
# licence artifacts (deploy/mirror/), not something a spike directory does by
# accident.
mirror/

# The venv this spike needs (osmnx + pyosmium + pyrosm in one place, which no
# existing project venv provides).
.venv/

# osmnx's own Overpass response cache. Large, regenerable, and the attic-dated
# queries are reproducible from probe.py.
raw/overpass/

# Run logs.
raw/probe-run*.log

# The merged two-extract source the §11.7 border cell builds before clipping
# (~475 MB). probe.py deletes it on the way out; this catches the case where a
# run is interrupted mid-cell and leaves it behind.
raw/clips/*-merged.osm.pbf
